{
  "_comment": [
    "Fixture routes. Phase 1 takes the route as caller-supplied input — route generation,",
    "legCountFor and beat-schedule generation are all out of scope, because leg density by",
    "terrain and montage compression need terrain data and sim tuning that do not exist.",
    "",
    "The sim harness reads this file by path via findWorkspaceRoot, so nothing here is",
    "exported from the engine barrel.",
    "",
    "Node ids are generic on purpose (rule 11): the map uses real geography, but a FIXTURE",
    "must not encode behaviour against a named place.",
    "",
    "Each entry carries a `start` block: the preparation choices a real run makes on the",
    "preparation screen. Without them transport defaults to foot and money to 0, which makes",
    "every vehicle-constrained and cost-gated event unreachable — the walking skeleton caught",
    "exactly that, with 5 of 9 events never firing."
